---
---

<aside class="guide" aria-label="How to read a tile">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 56 56" class="guide-tile" aria-hidden="true">
    <rect x="0.75" y="0.75" width="54.5" height="54.5" rx="3" fill="var(--paper)" />
    <rect x="0.75" y="17" width="54.5" height="38.25" fill="var(--other)" />
    <rect x="0.75" y="0.75" width="54.5" height="54.5" rx="3" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" />
    <g class="halo">
      <text x="28" y="22" text-anchor="middle" font-size="18" font-weight="700" class="font-display" fill="var(--ink)">Xx</text>
      <text x="28" y="34" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">Element</text>
    </g>
    <text x="51" y="50" text-anchor="end" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#fff">70%</text>
  </svg>
  <dl>
    <div><dt>How full</dt><dd>share of world supply: the top country's, or the EU's</dd></div>
    <div>
      <dt>Colour</dt>
      <dd>
        <span class="swatch bg-cn"></span>China <span class="swatch bg-eu ml-2"></span>EU <span class="swatch bg-other ml-2"></span>anyone else
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div><dt>Step</dt><dd>refined output where we have it, mined if not</dd></div>
    <div>
      <dt>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 30 14" class="inline h-3 w-6 align-baseline" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M2,12 Q15,-2 26,10" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" />
          <path d="M23,6 L28,12 L21,12 z" fill="var(--ink)" />
        </svg>
        <span class="sr-only">Arrow</span>
      </dt>
      <dd>by-product: comes out of the other's ore</dd>
    </div>
    <div><dt class="q">?</dt><dd>no usable figures</dd></div>
    <div><dt class="faded">Zn</dt><dd>faded: the rest of the table, not on the EU list</dd></div>
  </dl>
</aside>

<style>
  .guide {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .guide-tile {
    width: 3.5rem;
    height: 3.5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .guide :global(.halo text) {
    paint-order: stroke;
    stroke: var(--paper);
    stroke-width: 2.4px;
  }
  dl {
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.3rem 1.6rem;
  }
  dl > div {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  dt {
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-family: "Familjen Grotesk", ui-sans-serif, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .faded {
    color: #bdb8ad;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .q {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 1.05rem;
    height: 1.05rem;
    border: 1.2px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 2px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }
</style>
